# Derived from Arch packaging commit 0c178d550ec6392265d3a443333229823634bd08.
# Opt-in admission experiment; no installation or boot hooks added here.
# Upstream maintainer: Jan Alexander Steffens (heftig) <heftig@archlinux.org>

